    "details": "An issue was discovered in the function `mark_beginning_as_normal` in nfa.c in flex 2.6.4. There is a stack exhaustion problem caused by the `mark_beginning_as_normal` function making recursive calls to itself in certain scenarios involving lots of '*' characters. Remote attackers could leverage this vulnerability to cause a denial-of-service.",
